7. Risks & Mitigations
Adoption Risk: Users continue using email. -> Mitigation: Communication campaigns & portal integration.

Data Leakage: Unauthorized access to sensitive info. -> Mitigation: Strict Access Control implementation.

Hallucinations: AI inventing procedures. -> Mitigation: RAG architecture (strict adherence to docs) & Feedback loop.

Knowledge Gaps: Complex questions. -> Mitigation: Automatic redirection to Support/ServiceNow for low-confidence scores.

